**`rust/src/lib.rs`** — added `filter_by_tag` (lines 43-49):
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes
        .iter()
        .filter(|n| n.tags.contains(&tag.to_string()))
        .collect()
}
```
- Exact match against each note's `tags` vector via `Vec::contains`
- Returns references, preserves input order

**`rust/src/main.rs`** — wired `--tag` into `list` (lines 33-39):
