    .map(|tag| filter_by_tag(&notes, tag))
    .unwrap_or_else(|| notes.iter().collect());
```
- Scans args after the command name for `--tag <VALUE>`
- If present, filters through `filter_by_tag`; otherwise shows all notes (unchanged default)

